<title>USA: TABLE - Applied Analytical Q2 net decreases.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Applied Analytical Q2 net decreases.</headline>
<dateline>WILMINGTON, N.C. 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.04		    $0.06</p>
<p> Net			    583			741</p>
<p> Revs			15,767		   10,849</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  16,417		   11,918</p>
<p>			  6 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.09		    $0.12</p>
<p> Net			  1,493		    1,396</p>
<p> Revs			30,989		   20,744</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  16,429		   11,918</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE:  Applied Analytical Industries Inc said the 1997 to 1996 comparison was impacted by a 38 percent increase in the number of shares outstanding as a result of its initial public offering in September 1996.</p>
<p>The company also said that it had been engaged in discussions with a substantially larger third party concerning a potential business combination transaction and that at the request of the third party, it suspended new licensing arrangements during the second quarter of 1997, which had an adverse effect on those results.</p>
</text>
